<title>USA: Advanced Environmental plant hit by fire.</title>
<headline>Advanced Environmental plant hit by fire.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGDALE, Ark. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Environmental Recycling Technologies Inc Tuesday said fire hit its Rogers, Ark., plastic reclamation facility on Dec 15, damaging a portion of the facility.</p>
<p>The facility recently recommenced manufacturing operations after rebuilding from a fire in September.</p>
<p>The company said it will supply its composites manufacturing facility with plastic in the interim through additional sources.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
